1
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:41,040
Marshal, you're finally here.

2
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:43,400
The whole city's fans are waiting for

3
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:45,660
tonight's "Bloodstained Pear Garden".

4
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:47,640
Your box is ready.

5
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:49,240
Your clothes are ironed.

6
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:56,160
Hurry and help the Marshal change.

7
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:10,160
The Marshal's outfit is very precious

8
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:11,600
and can't be mishandled.

9
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:13,200
The servants are clumsy.

10
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:14,120
How can they handle it?

11
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:17,680
It's better if the Marshal holds
it himself to match your prestige.

12
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:18,600
You're right.

13
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:22,340
Such a precious outfit
should indeed be held by myself.

14
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:29,240
Thank you.

15
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:32,240
Marshal, this way please.

16
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:34,600
This girl is so pretty.

17
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:36,280
Come help me with my makeup.

18
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:38,600
You go to the wardrobe
and manage the costumes for me.

19
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:41,039
You help in the kitchen.

20
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:42,930
The Marshal will dine tonight.

21
00:01:43,479 --> 00:01:45,200
As for this lead actor,

22
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:46,800
come with me.

23
00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:07,000
Get out.

24
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:12,740
With your build playing the lead,
their eyesight isn't very good.

25
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:15,200
Your button.

26
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:18,329
This broken button.

27
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:31,280
You have deft hands, Dr. Xiao.

28
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:36,240
I'm used to it. Suturing during
autopsies is finer than this.

29
00:02:42,320 --> 00:02:44,600
Fourth stop, Bloodstained Pear Garden.

30
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:48,680
Rule one: Once in the play,
you are the character.

31
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:50,079
Words and actions
must not break character.

32
00:02:50,079 --> 00:02:52,800
Violators will trigger
the marionette punishment.

33
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:56,800
Rule two: The final act
must be completed before midnight

34
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:58,120
by killing the destined person,

35
00:02:58,120 --> 00:03:00,780
or everyone will be trapped
in the play forever.

36
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,200
Yang,

37
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:07,440
what does the rule mean
by not breaking character?

38
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:09,640
Words and actions
must not break character.

39
00:03:09,640 --> 00:03:12,120
It means we must play our respective roles

40
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:14,480
and act exactly according to the script.

41
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:17,400
Does that mean as long as
we follow the script

42
00:03:18,079 --> 00:03:20,320
and kill the destined person,

43
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:21,200
we can pass?

44
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,520
That makes sense.

45
00:03:23,079 --> 00:03:26,400
But the question is,
who is the destined person?

46
00:03:31,079 --> 00:03:31,760
Yang,

47
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:34,160
could that person be among the audience?

48
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:36,720
It's possible.
Let's not alert them for now.

49
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:40,400
Has Xiao Han come out?

50
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:48,640
Let go.

51
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:53,520
The lead should go on stage.
Start the play.

52
00:04:00,480 --> 00:04:01,000
Act One:

53
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,800
The Marshal Interrogates the Famous Actor.

54
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:05,400
The famous actor colluded with the enemy.
The evidence is conclusive.

55
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:07,860
Please interrogate him yourself, Marshal.

56
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:12,200
Marshal, according to the script, this act

57
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:15,280
is thirty lashes within half an hour.

58
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:24,240
Do it. It's the rule of the game.

59
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:26,120
I can't hurt you.

60
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:28,800
Marshal, there's no mercy on this stage.

61
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,400
If you can't bear to do it,

62
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:32,320
this play can't go on.

63
00:04:32,640 --> 00:04:34,000
If we miss the time,

64
00:04:34,080 --> 00:04:37,010
everyone will have to stay here
and be buried with it.

65
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:41,960
Then I'll test the bottom line
of this rule.

66
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:56,360
Warning. Violating the script
will trigger the punishment mechanism.

67
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:04,280
This is the marionette punishment.

68
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:07,410
Liu Yiyang, your soft-heartedness
will kill everyone,

69
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,800
including yourself.

70
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:10,200
Follow the rules.

71
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:30,000
Bad news!

72
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,400
Someone's dead! Lixiang,

73
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:33,060
she died in the dressing room.

74
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:34,800
Her neck is covered in blood.

75
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:40,200
The good show has just begun.

76
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:45,060
I heard the lead is also
proficient in medicine.

77
00:05:45,200 --> 00:05:46,840
Please examine the body.

78
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:49,920
You have half an hour
to find the cause of death.

79
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:55,040
Act II: Autopsy
of the Famous Opera Singer.

80
00:05:55,159 --> 00:05:58,000
Find out the cause of death
within half an hour.

81
00:05:58,480 --> 00:06:00,480
Failure will trigger a punishment.

82
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:02,280
People who die of suffocation
instinctively scratch their necks.

83
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:04,480
There should be skin tissue
under her fingernails.

84
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,810
Her hands are too clean.

85
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:06,800
What does this mean?

86
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,600
Look, there are signs
of pulling on her collar.

87
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:10,000
It looks like it was adjusted after death.

88
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:12,120
Cause of death detected as homicide.

89
00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:13,520
Telling the truth

90
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:15,160
will enrage the troupe's vengeful spirits

91
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:17,220
and trigger an indiscriminate hunt.

92
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:19,280
Simply lie to cover up the truth

93
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:21,520
to save the entire team

94
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:22,880
and safely clear this act.
